{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was a witch who lived in the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She would explore those woods in pursuit of a personal goal.  These woods were mysterious, but that would not stop her from completing her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wasn't alone of course.  She had her familiar Merlin, a housecat who slept on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is that of exploration and fantasy as she traverses these winter woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/extras/walking.gif?t=1760311071\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft resources and tools to explore deeper into the woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited day cycle that encourages you to plan how to explore each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics in a 3D monochromatic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely soundtrack by Dreamware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633020?t=1760311071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/c161f077376bd07a4b0fe0dc2572e440ec775b6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760311071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/15b1225d4ae580388f64c7624bd3106a885edc69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760311071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/15b1225d4ae580388f64c7624bd3106a885edc69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760311071","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4016400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There once was a witch who lived in the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She would explore those woods in pursuit of a personal goal.  These woods were mysterious, but that would not stop her from completing her quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wasn't alone of course.  She had her familiar Merlin, a housecat who slept on the couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her story is that of exploration and fantasy as she traverses these winter woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/extras/walking.gif?t=1760311071\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials to craft resources and tools to explore deeper into the woods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limited day cycle that encourages you to plan how to explore each day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn graphics in a 3D monochromatic world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lovely soundtrack by Dreamware</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the cat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["solarVagrant"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633020/b967f1eec708ea17e7e5bceefbc5cc734021e770/header.jpg?t=1760311071","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies